{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02725","headline":"奉和过旧宅应制 · 上官仪","name":"奉和过旧宅应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"石关清晚夏，璇舆御早秋。\n神麾扬珠雨，仙吹响飞流。\n沛水祥云泛，宛郊瑞气浮。\n大风迎汉筑，藂烟入舜球。\n翠梧临凤邸，滋兰带鹤舟。\n偃伯歌玄化，扈跸颂王游。\n遗簪谬昭奖，珥笔荷恩休。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"上官仪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02725.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02725","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}